---
title: Crêpes
portions: 4
---

## Batter ->&batter

In a #large bowl{}, mix @flour{200g}, @sugar{1 tbsp} and a pinch of @salt{}.
Add @egg{2}|@egg substitute{2} and whisk for ~{2min}.
// Rest the batter before cooking
Let rest at ^{fridge} for ~{30min}.

## Cooking

Heat a #pan{} on ^{medium heat}.
Pour &batter{} and cook for ~{active 1min}.
